  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for Involuntary Resettlement in Energy Sector in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of this grant is to support capacity enhancementstrengthening the country systems  for planning and implementing involuntary resettlement in Vietnam&apos;s transmission grid investments with focus on efficiency while addressing social and economic impacts. The project consists of three components: (i) a review of current practices applied in energy projects in Vietnam; (ii) capacity building activities with strong focus on international best practices (including the World Bank); and  (iii) monitoring and evaluation activities to understand the impacts of the initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
